    "estimated": "10.00 occ x 15 min/occ (estimate, mid of 5-45, basis observed, 6 quotes from 6 occurrences) = 150.00 min = 19.18 min/mo; automatable 60% (estimate) = 11.51 min/mo; at the low end 5 min/occ = $9.72/mo, at the high end 45 min/occ = $53.20/mo (the row's automatable total)",
